WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.567
-We don't always
have enough time to cover

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:03.767
all of the recent news,
so here with a recap

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.467
is one of our writers
Amber Ruffin

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:08.467
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What?"

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:10.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:14.601
-You guys!
Things have been crazy.

00:00:14.601 --> 00:00:16.968
First of all,
Jay Z joined Instagram,

00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:18.634
and I was like --
[ Gasps ] -- "What?"

00:00:18.634 --> 00:00:21.901
Then he amassed
2 million followers in one day,

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:23.767
and I was like, "Whaaat?"

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:28.067
Then he quit a day later, and I
was like, "What...a smart move."

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.667
Then, Facebook changed its name
to Meta, and I was like,

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:35.934
"What? Meta?
How am I gonna adjust

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:39.234
to this very big name change?
Let me try it out.

00:00:39.234 --> 00:00:42.667
Uncle Joe, quit believing
everything you read on Meta!"

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:44.767
Oh, still works.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:46.634
But I'll tell you
what doesn't work.

00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:48.834
My stubborn Uncle Joe.

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:52.200
Then, the emoji council
released a beans emoji,

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.634
and I was like, "What?

00:00:54.634 --> 00:00:58.033
Council?
There's a whole emoji council?"

00:00:58.033 --> 00:01:01.133
I was like, "Yes.
Beans cute, but council?

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:03.534
They all wearing robes
and conjuring up visions

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:05.300
in an orb council?"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.567
Emoji council?
What?

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:10.701
Which one of us got the meaning
for the word "council" wrong?

00:01:10.701 --> 00:01:13.300
Council?
As in a council met

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.100
and deliberated,
and they came up with this?

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.868
It's emojis!
All you need is a 24-year-old

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:20.000
improvisor with a pad and a pen.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.501
Man, that emoji news
had me all like...

00:01:23.501 --> 00:01:25.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.901
And then, I heard Bezos
offered Tom Hanks

00:01:27.901 --> 00:01:29.901
a seat on his rocketship
to space.

00:01:29.901 --> 00:01:31.334
And I was like, "What?

00:01:31.334 --> 00:01:33.767
Tom Hanks
doesn't want to go to space?

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:35.834
That man was in 'Apollo 13,'

00:01:35.834 --> 00:01:38.267
and he does not want to go
to space with you."

00:01:38.267 --> 00:01:41.501
This man had
to land a plane in the Hudson.

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:44.334
He has no need to go to space.

00:01:44.334 --> 00:01:47.734
This man has found true love
with a mermaid.

00:01:47.734 --> 00:01:51.133
He does not yearn to wander
to the final frontier.

00:01:51.133 --> 00:01:52.834
It makes no sense!

00:01:52.834 --> 00:01:57.100
Then, a woman who participated
in the January 6th insurrection

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:59.634
bragged on social media
that she wouldn't go to jail

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:02.133
because she's white with
blonde hair and has a good job,

00:02:02.133 --> 00:02:04.267
and I was like, "Whaaaat?"

00:02:04.267 --> 00:02:07.434
Every part of that is wrong.
But blonde?

00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:09.300
There are
no blonde people in jail?

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:12.567
What?
Paris Hilton went to jail.

00:02:12.567 --> 00:02:15.100
Martha Stewart went to jail.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:18.033
Felicity Huffman,
she went to jail.

00:02:18.033 --> 00:02:19.968
And if you told me those
were the only blonde women

00:02:19.968 --> 00:02:22.634
to ever go to jail,
I would believe that.

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:25.400
Anyway, that woman was sentenced
to 60 days in jail,

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.834
so it's at least
four blonde women in jail.

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:30.467
[ Cheers and applause ]
1, 2, 3, 4 -- 4.

00:02:30.467 --> 00:02:32.501
Then I found out
that Kristen Stewart

00:02:32.501 --> 00:02:35.667
is getting married!
And I was like, "What fun!"

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:38.067
Then I heard that Guy Fieri
was gonna officiate,

00:02:38.067 --> 00:02:41.467
and I was like, "What?
Guy Fieri? What?"

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:42.734
I did not know it was gonna be

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:45.334
a destination wedding
in Flavortown.

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:46.701
I love it!

00:02:46.701 --> 00:02:49.400
And that wasn't even the
craziest celebrity wedding news.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.868
Then, Kal Penn
tweeted about being on a plane

00:02:51.868 --> 00:02:54.300
and sitting near Cardi B.
and how he wanted her

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:57.901
to officiate his wedding,
and she tweeted she would.

00:02:57.901 --> 00:03:00.667
I was like, "What?!"
Because -- true story --

00:03:00.667 --> 00:03:03.267
I sat next to Kal
on a flight, too,

00:03:03.267 --> 00:03:05.801
and he didn't ask me
to do [bleep]

00:03:05.801 --> 00:03:09.300
Then, I found out Aaron Rodgers
got COVID, and I was like,

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:11.801
"This cannot be."
Aaron Rodgers,

00:03:11.801 --> 00:03:14.334
the kid I went
to elementary school with?

00:03:14.334 --> 00:03:16.267
And they were like,
"No, the Green Bay quarterback,

00:03:16.267 --> 00:03:18.534
Aaron Rodgers."
And I was like, "What?"

00:03:18.534 --> 00:03:21.100
And then I found out
that he had tricked everyone

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.934
into thinking
that he was vaccinated.

00:03:22.934 --> 00:03:25.200
And I was like, "Wh-a-a-at?

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:29.067
Finally, football has enough
drama for me."

00:03:29.067 --> 00:03:30.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.467 --> 00:03:33.501
Just kidding.
This is very bad, and I hate it.

00:03:33.501 --> 00:03:36.067
When a reporter
asked if he was vaccinated,

00:03:36.067 --> 00:03:37.801
he said he was "immunized."

00:03:37.801 --> 00:03:39.934
Now, you know
he was lying right there.

00:03:39.934 --> 00:03:42.868
Whenever people use a different
word to answer a question,

00:03:42.868 --> 00:03:44.968
it is a telltale sign
they're lying.

00:03:44.968 --> 00:03:46.534
"Hey, are you married?"

00:03:46.534 --> 00:03:48.734
"You don't see a ring
on my finger, do you?"

00:03:48.734 --> 00:03:51.100
"Good enough for me."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:54.133
Now, to Rodgers' credit,
he may have been lying,

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:57.701
but his whole vibe
was trying to tell us the truth.

00:03:57.701 --> 00:04:01.667
Then, in the Virginia governor's
race, there was a commercial

00:04:01.667 --> 00:04:04.200
where a mom
tried to get a book banned

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:07.634
because she said it made
her son uncomfortable.

00:04:07.634 --> 00:04:10.534
And I was like,
"What are you doing with it?

00:04:10.534 --> 00:04:12.567
Is this child
sitting on a book?"

00:04:12.567 --> 00:04:15.467
But it turns out
it was a Toni Morrison book.

00:04:15.467 --> 00:04:17.067
Now, people are always
trying to get her books

00:04:17.067 --> 00:04:19.834
banned from schools,
and I'm always like, "What?"

00:04:19.834 --> 00:04:21.701
Stories about the effects
of slavery

00:04:21.701 --> 00:04:25.434
make you feel uncomfortable?
Bitch, try living them!"

00:04:25.434 --> 00:04:29.167
Then, something utterly
unbelievable happened.

00:04:29.167 --> 00:04:33.300
Hundreds of QAnon believers
showed up in Dallas, because --

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:35.901
and this is real --
I did not believe, like,

00:04:35.901 --> 00:04:39.033
the first like four articles
I read about it.

00:04:39.033 --> 00:04:40.067
But it's true.

00:04:40.067 --> 00:04:43.267
They were expecting
to see JFK Jr.

00:04:43.267 --> 00:04:46.100
Now, I read this
and was like, "What?!

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:48.934
You were expecting
to see JFK Jr.?

00:04:48.934 --> 00:04:50.701
What?
Why did you expect him

00:04:50.701 --> 00:04:53.300
to show up,
and what were you expecting?

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:55.701
A man who has not aged?
An old man?

00:04:55.701 --> 00:04:57.434
A zombie?
What?

00:04:57.434 --> 00:04:59.400
Do you have a sixth sense?

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.534
What about senses
one through five?

00:05:01.534 --> 00:05:03.400
What?"
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.834
"Who was he rolling with?

00:05:04.834 --> 00:05:07.033
Santa, the Tooth Fairy,
Genghis Khan?

00:05:07.033 --> 00:05:08.534
What are the rules?"

00:05:08.534 --> 00:05:10.701
Then I found out
that they thought JFK Jr.

00:05:10.701 --> 00:05:12.634
was coming back
to be Trump's running mate.

00:05:12.634 --> 00:05:15.501
And I was like, "What?!"
[ Laughter ]

00:05:15.501 --> 00:05:18.968
You think a famous Democrat came
back from the dead

00:05:18.968 --> 00:05:22.534
to be
the Republican vice president?

00:05:22.534 --> 00:05:26.634
A position, by the way, which
almost got the last guy hung?

00:05:26.634 --> 00:05:28.067
[ Laughter ]
What?

00:05:28.067 --> 00:05:31.167
How do you function
in your day-to-day life?

00:05:31.167 --> 00:05:33.667
Because if you start out
waiting for word from somebody

00:05:33.667 --> 00:05:37.367
who has been dead since 1999,
you can't possibly run yourself

00:05:37.367 --> 00:05:40.667
a bath or open a jar.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:40.667 --> 00:05:42.968
How do you send or receive mail?

00:05:42.968 --> 00:05:46.133
Do you have a bank account?
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.133 --> 00:05:48.133
What will you do
to keep yourself safe

00:05:48.133 --> 00:05:49.501
from misinformation?

00:05:49.501 --> 00:05:51.767
Will you take your computer
and throw it into the sun?

00:05:51.767 --> 00:05:56.868
Please, take your computer
and throw it into the sun.

00:05:56.868 --> 00:06:00.834
Uncle Joe, take your computer
and throw it into the sun!

00:06:00.834 --> 00:06:02.601
This has been "Amber Says What?"

00:06:02.601 --> 00:06:04.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

